{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203410","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203410","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1320341001:1":{"text":"You actually hurt a ton of my mercenaries! I'm going to make you pay for this!!!","source_cn":"你们这群混账……居然打伤了我这么多佣兵！这可都是要赔钱的！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBB7010E8F965A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320341002:1":{"text":"Everyone, listen up! I lent this old man money for his son to see a doctor, and now that Levski's gone, he thinks he can get away with violence instead of paying me back!","source_cn":"左邻右舍都来瞧瞧，这就是老叶甫根尼和列夫斯基的行事作风...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84DCC26C9EEFD993","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320341003:1":{"text":"What?! You're the one who threw the first punch!","source_cn":"什么啊？！明明是你先动的手！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A68D3765D44A0D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320341004:1":{"text":"Let's talk about Levski. He always acted so superior, going on and on about art, kissing up to the nobles!","source_cn":"得了吧！你们说说列夫斯基这个人，从前自诩清高，满嘴都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67863B5563304931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320341005:1":{"text":"But when he got sick, not one of those nobles bothered to visit him. Only we decent folks were willing to lend him money! And now that he's gone, his father won't pay us back!","source_cn":"他病倒之后，那些老爷可没一个过来探望的，只有我们这些好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F9C8DA14FD44919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320341006:1":{"text":"What a lousy bunch with no integrity! I mean, his illness? That's just karma coming back around!","source_cn":"要我说啊，他得的病就是神明的惩罚！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8EDCEB73991541","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320341007:1":{"text":"You... how could you say something like that!","source_cn":"你……你瞎说什么！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16CE0900C2983E8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320341008:1":{"text":"Hmph! Evgeny, these nosy people will leave soon enough, but you can't escape your debts.","source_cn":"哼，老叶甫根尼，我劝你早点认命。这些多管闲事的人早晚要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89D1E6C450052C38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320341009:1":{"text":"If you don't pay up soon, I might actually—","source_cn":"可别惹急了我，不然我真对你动——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F552962FD71202","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320341010:1":{"text":"Did I just hear you say the word \"karma\"?","source_cn":"你刚才说，“生病是神明的惩罚”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA698600D74CAF22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320341011:1":{"text":"I demand you repeat what you just said.","source_cn":"这句话是什么意思？我不太理解，想请你解释一下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A42878255711F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1320341012:1":{"text":"Y-you're an undead!!!","source_cn":"你、你你你……是活死人！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA1EA3B398D601ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320341013:1":{"text":"You still haven't answered my question.","source_cn":"你还没回答我的问题。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44CB4BF267B0A2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320341014:1":{"text":"I... I promise I won't come back! Just let me go!!","source_cn":"我……我……我不会再来了！放过我吧！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1320240089F93887","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320341015:1":{"text":"Hmph... He sure can make a quick exit!","source_cn":"哼……跑得倒是够快的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BAB8F66B5FFC8D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:讨债的商人":{"text":"Debt Collector","source":"讨债的商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老叶甫根尼":{"text":"Evgeny","source":"老叶甫根尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"Ludovic","source":"柳博米尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":5}}